# Shell scripts must stay LF on every platform so Git Bash (Windows) can run
# them — CRLF breaks the `#!/usr/bin/env bash` shebang. The agent hooks under
# tools/lazuli-hooks/ are bash; without this pin a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true would rewrite them to CRLF and the hooks would fail.
*.sh text eol=lf
